### Auth — Homebase API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### Registration creates both User (better-auth) and linked UserProfile (phone, role, nationalId)

### 1. Register a Property Owner
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "+254700000001",
  "role": "OWNER",
  "nationalId": "12345678"
}

### 2. Register a Caretaker
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "caretaker@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "+254700000002",
  "role": "CARETAKER",
  "nationalId": "23456789"
}

### 3. Register a Tenant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Tenant",
  "email": "tenant@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "+254700000003",
  "role": "TENANT",
  "nationalId": "34567890"
}

### 4. Sign In (Better Auth)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Get Current Session / User
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/get-session
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Sign Out (Better Auth)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-out
Content-Type: application/json
